## 1. Welcome to MedSync Health

### 1.1 Our Mission and Vision

Welcome to MedSync Health, a leading company in the **Healthcare Technology** industry. Since our founding in **January 2019**, we have been dedicated to revolutionizing healthcare through our innovative digital health platform. Our success is built on a foundation of rapid growth, evidenced by our **Series D** funding stage and a total of **AED 992,250,000** raised to date. Our mission is to connect and simplify healthcare for everyone.

### 1.2 Company Overview

MedSync Health operates globally with its headquarters in **Boston, MA, USA**, and major offices in London, Berlin, and Singapore. We are a team of **1,200** dedicated employees worldwide, working under the leadership of our CEO, **Dr. Sarah Chen**. Our collective efforts have resulted in a strong financial position, with **FY 2024 Revenue of AED 485,100,000** and a **Gross Margin of 75.0%**.

